  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resettlement Programme with the Government of Switzerland from Lebanon, Egypt, and Turkey in 2022-2023 Phase VII</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program will provide comprehensive resettlement support to 830 refugees from T&#xfc;rkiye, Lebanon and Egypt. IOM is supporting the selection mission, facilitating the visa and travel document processing and is providing health assessments and pre-embarkation checks to establish fitness to travel. IOM is also delivering 3-day pre-departure orientation sessions to all refugees in order to prepare them for their future life in Switzerland. Finally, IOM is providing movement management and operational support to Switzerland.</narrative>
  </description>
